WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 25]

01:44.400 --> 01:46.100
So I watched them from afar

01:47.350 --> 01:48.410
and felt happy for them.

01:52.200 --> 01:53.380
So...

01:54.920 --> 01:56.820
are you moping because you gave up on unrequited love?

02:02.430 --> 02:04.660
- Can you ever stop talking? - Ow!

02:05.070 --> 02:06.660
Poison...

02:16.080 --> 02:17.290
Even the crows outside

02:17.290 --> 02:18.240
sound better than you.

02:28.960 --> 02:30.820
I don't even know how they're doing

02:31.120 --> 02:31.980
in Nan'an City.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.100
Where are they?

02:55.000 --> 02:55.850
They ate their fill,

02:56.080 --> 02:56.940
then headed back to the clinic.

02:57.280 --> 02:58.610
My girl even dragged the Medicine King along.

02:59.280 --> 02:59.850
She told me

03:00.240 --> 03:01.780
to have you rush this flower cake

03:01.910 --> 03:03.100
to the clinic for her.

03:04.960 --> 03:05.380
Waiter.

03:06.240 --> 03:06.940
Send it to He-Yu Clinic.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.690
Got it. Thanks, sir.

03:18.630 --> 03:19.410
What happened?

03:20.000 --> 03:20.690
We've got a lead.

03:21.310 --> 03:22.540
The First Prince went to Tianqi City.

03:22.800 --> 03:23.290
The others

03:23.840 --> 03:24.380
went to the Tang Clan.

03:25.630 --> 03:26.220
Figures.

03:26.870 --> 03:27.660
Since they lost

03:27.800 --> 03:28.540
in Wushuang City,

03:29.240 --> 03:30.610
they'd chase a new target.

03:31.870 --> 03:33.380
Never thought it'd be the Tang Clan.

03:37.280 --> 03:38.450
Tang Clan

03:38.560 --> 03:40.380
is one of the clans most skilled

03:40.430 --> 03:41.260
in poison and crooked arts.

03:42.080 --> 03:43.220
If Night Crow

03:43.240 --> 03:44.220
goes there with a crew,

03:44.800 --> 03:45.500
this whole thing

03:45.710 --> 03:46.540
won't be simple.

03:47.960 --> 03:49.170
Tang Clan is under the Prince of Langya's sway.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.220
The earlier hit

03:51.240 --> 03:52.220
on Second Master Tang

03:52.870 --> 03:53.820
was aimed at Tang Lianyue,

03:53.910 --> 03:55.130
the Prince of Langya's favorite.

03:56.150 --> 03:58.410
Maybe behind it all

03:59.870 --> 04:00.730
stands the First Prince.

04:03.150 --> 04:03.660
So,

04:04.120 --> 04:05.130
what's it got to do with us?

04:07.710 --> 04:08.500
Yumo is still digging

04:08.520 --> 04:09.380
into the Tang Clan.

04:09.680 --> 04:10.540
Give her a little time.

04:14.030 --> 04:15.060
We'll work on something else for now,

04:15.080 --> 04:15.610
Su Muyu.

04:16.310 --> 04:17.660
We promised Blood River's folks

04:18.270 --> 04:19.540
we'd lead them to the Other Shore.

04:21.480 --> 04:22.020
How do you think

04:22.750 --> 04:23.490
about Nan'an City?

04:25.390 --> 04:27.810
Founding our sect here,

04:29.040 --> 04:30.410
some folks won't like it.

04:31.430 --> 04:32.700
Leave that to me.

04:34.160 --> 04:34.580
Sure thing.

04:35.270 --> 04:36.410
If it's on me,

04:36.920 --> 04:38.020
I'll cut down anyone

04:38.040 --> 04:39.170
who says no across Nan'an City.

04:43.120 --> 04:43.980
Then I'm out of it.

04:50.000 --> 04:50.580
Master Su.

04:52.000 --> 04:52.980
What brings you all here together?

04:54.720 --> 04:55.340
Who hurt you,

04:55.870 --> 04:56.290
Changli?

05:00.800 --> 05:02.170
Xuewei and I had just reached Nan'an City

05:02.600 --> 05:03.220
when we saw

05:03.510 --> 05:04.700
Lingxiao Sect disciples

05:04.750 --> 05:05.460
throwing Changli out.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.250
We were going

05:07.390 --> 05:08.340
to teach them a lesson.

05:08.720 --> 05:09.410
Xuewei even had her Poison Palm

05:09.430 --> 05:10.410
raised already.

05:10.750 --> 05:11.660
But Changli said

05:11.830 --> 05:12.810
you and the Patriarch ordered

05:13.160 --> 05:13.980
no taking lives.

05:14.920 --> 05:15.580
Changhe and Master Su

05:15.600 --> 05:17.020
sent me to find a prime site.

05:17.750 --> 05:18.950
A broker pointed me

05:18.950 --> 05:20.510
to an estate plot with great views and terrain,

05:20.510 --> 05:21.410
perfect for a manor.

05:21.950 --> 05:23.660
But it belongs to the Lingxiao Sect.

05:24.270 --> 05:25.630
A few of their disciples

05:25.630 --> 05:26.730
somehow got wind of it,

05:27.240 --> 05:28.100
and saw through me at a glance

05:28.120 --> 05:28.930
that I was of Blood River.

05:29.750 --> 05:31.580
They said Blood River isn't welcome in Nan'an City.

05:32.360 --> 05:33.840
They won't mind

05:33.840 --> 05:35.290
so long as we lie low and stay quiet.

05:36.430 --> 05:37.810
But if we want to settle openly,

05:38.190 --> 05:39.050
they'll be the first to block it.

05:40.430 --> 05:41.100
They also said...

05:41.100 --> 05:43.780
Blood River rats creeping toward the light?

05:44.800 --> 05:45.490
Aren't you afraid

05:46.360 --> 05:48.170
you'll be wiped out?

05:50.240 --> 05:52.050
You must be Master Su.

05:52.830 --> 05:53.900
By my master's order,

05:53.950 --> 05:55.540
I came after Blood River's disciples.

05:55.750 --> 05:56.540
Sorry to intrude.

05:57.560 --> 05:58.340
Never thought

05:58.750 --> 06:00.250
you really couldn't show your faces,

06:01.360 --> 06:03.020
holed up in a clinic.

06:15.310 --> 06:17.170
Blood River isn't what it used to be.

06:18.310 --> 06:19.640
Now we plan to found anew

06:19.640 --> 06:21.290
and scrap the old in Nan'an City.

06:22.720 --> 06:23.930
Will Lingxiao Sect forbid it?

06:24.680 --> 06:26.540
Most plots belong to rich families,

06:27.430 --> 06:29.370
and Lingxiao Sect and Daffodil House

06:29.480 --> 06:31.140
are close with those households.

06:31.800 --> 06:33.020
So we won't let them

06:33.310 --> 06:35.140
sell Blood River an inch.

06:35.920 --> 06:37.100
Our master says

06:37.680 --> 06:39.730
Blood River has too much blood on its hands.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.700
And Nan'an's too small a place,

06:42.480 --> 06:44.730
no room for killing fiends like you.

06:53.310 --> 06:54.540
Muyu, what's going on?

06:54.920 --> 06:55.850
Hongxi and Ziyi are both here

06:55.920 --> 06:56.930
to treat their wounds.

06:58.310 --> 06:59.020
Su Changli,

06:59.270 --> 07:00.220
you're hurt too?

07:01.000 --> 07:01.410
Come with me.

07:01.630 --> 07:02.250
I'll dress it.

07:02.830 --> 07:03.220
Okay.

07:08.560 --> 07:09.490
So you brought us

07:09.630 --> 07:10.540
to Nan'an on purpose

07:10.950 --> 07:11.930
for this, huh?

07:12.750 --> 07:13.970
You're really planning

07:14.120 --> 07:14.850
to found a sect here?

07:17.510 --> 07:18.730
Not exactly easy.

07:19.240 --> 07:19.780
Had I known,

07:19.950 --> 07:21.170
I'd have swapped with Uncle Qidao.

07:21.630 --> 07:22.490
He's a family head too.

07:23.430 --> 07:24.210
As for me,

07:24.240 --> 07:25.280
I'd stay with Xuewei

07:25.630 --> 07:26.340
to hold Blood River,

07:26.560 --> 07:27.100
and let him handle this.

07:29.190 --> 07:29.660
Forget it.

07:30.390 --> 07:31.220
If he came,

07:31.800 --> 07:33.410
he'd chop them all in one go.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.080
- Farewell. - Take care.

07:42.950 --> 07:43.410
Wait.

07:45.160 --> 07:45.900
Mr. Su,

07:46.560 --> 07:48.020
I know you're connected to the miracle physician

07:48.070 --> 07:49.220
at He-Yu Clinic.

07:50.120 --> 07:51.370
I'm not making things hard,

07:52.120 --> 07:53.280
but Lingxiao Sect

07:53.280 --> 07:54.630
and Daffodil House have ordered

07:54.920 --> 07:56.900
no land can be sold to you.

07:57.360 --> 07:59.340
If you truly need a plot,

07:59.560 --> 08:00.250
you might ask around

08:00.630 --> 08:02.340
at Changsheng Sect's base.

08:02.800 --> 08:03.580
Changsheng Sect?

08:04.160 --> 08:05.050
This sect

08:05.430 --> 08:07.100
isn't a local power.

08:07.430 --> 08:09.100
They came from Sihuai City.

08:09.920 --> 08:10.690
Sure,

08:10.720 --> 08:12.170
you can't fight City Hall.

08:13.270 --> 08:14.900
Yet this Changsheng Sect

08:15.160 --> 08:16.160
still tore a chunk

08:16.160 --> 08:17.490
from Lingxiao Sect

08:17.490 --> 08:18.660
and Daffodil House.

08:19.630 --> 08:20.100
Now,

08:20.240 --> 08:21.040
the parcels in Nan'an City

08:21.040 --> 08:22.540
outside those two factions' control

08:23.040 --> 08:24.410
are all in their hands.

08:25.560 --> 08:26.050
Thanks.

08:26.190 --> 08:26.730
Stop!

08:28.000 --> 08:29.170
Made a scene in our place?

08:29.950 --> 08:30.410
Get him!

08:34.510 --> 08:34.980
Stop!

08:40.510 --> 08:41.010
Who is he?

08:48.750 --> 08:49.370
Who are you?

08:49.790 --> 08:50.980
He's just a kid.

08:51.720 --> 08:52.890
Why hit him so hard?

08:53.510 --> 08:54.220
You promised

08:54.720 --> 08:55.530
if I won the ring,

08:55.550 --> 08:56.490
the prize would be mine.

08:57.000 --> 08:57.940
Why break your word?

08:58.270 --> 08:59.770
You're just an inn waiter.

09:00.030 --> 09:00.980
How could you possibly beat

09:01.080 --> 09:02.250
our sect's expert?

09:02.510 --> 09:03.060
Yeah!

09:03.440 --> 09:04.850
You must have cheated.

09:05.270 --> 09:06.460
Come explain yourself back with us.

09:07.000 --> 09:08.580
Who stays a waiter for life?

09:10.600 --> 09:11.820
I won on my own.

09:12.510 --> 09:13.010
I know.

09:13.630 --> 09:14.340
Sir,

09:14.750 --> 09:16.300
stop meddling...

09:16.630 --> 09:17.770
The lowest courage

09:18.480 --> 09:19.490
comes from anger.

09:30.630 --> 09:31.370
Incredible!

09:32.320 --> 09:32.940
No way...

09:33.150 --> 09:34.610
Wasn't he just standing still there?

09:35.910 --> 09:37.220
Then how did our blades break?

09:37.910 --> 09:38.610
I just felt

09:39.200 --> 09:40.800
a surge of powerful inner force...

09:42.720 --> 09:43.980
Who's making trouble here?

09:44.120 --> 09:44.730
- Sir. - Sir.

09:47.670 --> 09:48.850
What's going on?

09:50.080 --> 09:51.340
Who broke their blades?

09:51.790 --> 09:52.300
I did.

09:54.000 --> 09:54.980
Who are you?

09:55.150 --> 09:55.980
Where'd you come from.

09:57.270 --> 09:57.770
Ge Xiu.

09:59.420 --> 10:00.440
You little punk.

10:00.600 --> 10:02.300
How dare you call me by name?

10:03.000 --> 10:03.770
You want to die?

10:06.670 --> 10:07.180
Oh, wait...

10:07.840 --> 10:09.530
How do you know my real name?

10:10.270 --> 10:11.180
This is Ge Changsheng,

10:11.510 --> 10:12.420
Master of Changsheng Sect.

10:13.080 --> 10:14.770
Three years since Heishui Stronghold,

10:15.790 --> 10:16.700
looks like you've grown.

10:21.080 --> 10:21.420
You...

10:23.480 --> 10:23.980
you're...

10:27.270 --> 10:27.700
Well...

10:28.600 --> 10:29.580
just a misunderstanding.

10:30.480 --> 10:31.220
If it's a misunderstanding,

10:31.840 --> 10:33.100
why are their blades still raised?

10:35.630 --> 10:36.010
Insolent!

10:36.150 --> 10:37.460
- You're insolent! - Insolent!

10:37.480 --> 10:38.220
Stop...

10:38.390 --> 10:38.820
No...

10:39.480 --> 10:39.850
Uh...

10:40.150 --> 10:41.890
I... I didn't mean you.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.100
I meant them.

10:44.550 --> 10:45.340
Are you lot stupid?

10:45.510 --> 10:46.180
Are you stupid, huh?

10:47.200 --> 10:47.890
Put the blades away, now!

10:48.440 --> 10:48.850
Got it.

10:49.510 --> 10:49.890
Uh...

10:49.900 --> 10:50.650
What's with this situation?

10:50.910 --> 10:52.080
I failed to discipline my men.

10:52.320 --> 10:52.940
Don't take offense.

10:55.600 --> 10:57.180
I heard you were the bully of Sihuai City.

10:58.150 --> 10:59.010
But this is Nan'an City.

10:59.720 --> 11:00.770
You know this place so well too?

11:03.840 --> 11:05.100
Let's talk privately.

11:05.600 --> 11:06.370
As it happens,

11:06.720 --> 11:07.650
I need your help with something.

11:10.790 --> 11:13.200
Back then, thanks to you sparing me,

11:13.750 --> 11:15.130
I kept my life,

11:15.550 --> 11:17.530
and Changsheng Sect exists today.

11:18.960 --> 11:19.610
Back then,

11:19.840 --> 11:21.220
you worked at Heishui Stronghold,

11:22.030 --> 11:23.420
yet saved many innocents.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.700
You earned that life yourself.

11:27.390 --> 11:28.340
Enough of the past.

11:29.390 --> 11:30.490
Let's talk about what I mentioned.

11:33.550 --> 11:34.560
Starting

11:34.600 --> 11:36.480
a new Blood River in Nan'an City

11:37.550 --> 11:38.420
is actually..

11:40.320 --> 11:41.390
a hard sell.

11:46.930 --> 11:48.500
Right now in Nan'an,

11:49.480 --> 11:50.650
we can't find a single broker

11:50.650 --> 11:52.300
willing to sell us land.

11:56.550 --> 11:57.100
Still,

11:57.550 --> 11:59.460
since I'm handling business here

12:00.120 --> 12:01.820
and happened to meet you,

12:02.960 --> 12:03.820
this matter

12:04.200 --> 12:05.060
is on me!

12:05.510 --> 12:06.100
I promise,

12:06.670 --> 12:07.300
first thing tomorrow,

12:07.360 --> 12:08.130
the deed

12:08.360 --> 12:09.250
will be delivered to your clinic.

12:11.600 --> 12:12.340
Then I'll trouble you.

12:13.360 --> 12:13.730
Much appreciated.

12:14.270 --> 12:14.770
Don't mention it!

12:38.150 --> 12:39.250
What is this crappy array,

12:39.790 --> 12:40.850
like a turtle shell?

12:41.150 --> 12:42.180
I can't find a single weak spot.

12:42.960 --> 12:44.300
I invented this formation.

12:44.870 --> 12:45.940
It even blocks your poison.

12:46.550 --> 12:47.370
For the moment,

12:47.750 --> 12:48.730
no flaw to be found.

12:49.390 --> 12:49.770
No.

12:50.480 --> 12:51.530
I found a flaw.

12:53.200 --> 12:53.610
What's it?

12:54.360 --> 12:55.650
Put away this turtle shell first,

12:55.650 --> 12:56.320
and I'll tell you.

12:59.670 --> 13:00.340
What flaw?

13:04.120 --> 13:04.960
I'm dead.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.000
I'm dead.

13:06.320 --> 13:07.340
I'm dead...

13:07.750 --> 13:08.890
Quit acting.

13:09.510 --> 13:10.580
I didn't even touch you.

13:10.790 --> 13:11.850
You were ready for that move.

13:13.790 --> 13:15.180
I just wanted to make you laugh.

13:16.960 --> 13:17.370
Xuewei,

13:18.030 --> 13:18.700
what do you think?

13:19.150 --> 13:20.010
My formation

13:20.360 --> 13:21.010
with your poison,

13:21.720 --> 13:22.100
how is it?

13:22.840 --> 13:24.300
If so...

13:30.150 --> 13:30.720
Muyu,

13:30.840 --> 13:31.570
you done talking?

13:32.960 --> 13:33.370
Done.

13:34.240 --> 13:34.850
So,

13:35.390 --> 13:36.930
when are we moving Blood River's base

13:37.030 --> 13:37.700
to this city?

13:38.600 --> 13:39.260
Or maybe we should

13:39.320 --> 13:40.940
simply move the clinic into Blood River?

13:43.240 --> 13:44.220
What a rotten idea.

13:44.960 --> 13:45.980
You want patients coming into Blood River

13:46.030 --> 13:47.010
to see the miracle physician?

13:47.390 --> 13:47.890
Who would come?

13:50.120 --> 13:50.820
That problem

13:51.360 --> 13:52.610
might be solved by morning.

13:54.620 --> 14:00.080
[He-Yu Clinic]

14:00.080 --> 14:01.300
The Changsheng folks aren't here yet?

14:01.790 --> 14:02.180
Not yet.

14:02.870 --> 14:03.460
It's already noon.

14:04.000 --> 14:05.030
Did Ge Changsheng

14:05.240 --> 14:06.300
go back on his word?

14:07.240 --> 14:07.770
Wait a bit more.

14:08.270 --> 14:08.700
Mr. Su!

14:10.910 --> 14:11.950
Early this morning,

14:11.950 --> 14:13.300
a bunch of officials showed up

14:13.670 --> 14:14.850
and seized Master Ge.

14:15.480 --> 14:16.890
I barely managed to escape.

14:17.870 --> 14:19.070
They said

14:19.600 --> 14:21.940
Master Ge killed the Prefect's son.

14:22.840 --> 14:23.340
What?

14:24.870 --> 14:26.100
When it rains,

14:26.790 --> 14:27.460
it pours.

14:28.510 --> 14:29.700
I know what you're about to do.

14:30.600 --> 14:31.490
What did you find?

14:32.870 --> 14:33.490
Ge Changsheng,

14:34.080 --> 14:35.850
Sihuai City's infamous scoundrel,

14:36.390 --> 14:37.250
Master of Changsheng Sect.

14:37.790 --> 14:38.460
This time,

14:38.670 --> 14:40.340
he had an antiques deal with the Prefect's son,

14:40.790 --> 14:42.180
and the deal was sealed.

14:43.030 --> 14:44.060
That was last night.

14:44.630 --> 14:45.100
Last night?

14:46.000 --> 14:46.700
Ge Changsheng

14:46.720 --> 14:47.700
did only two things.

14:48.120 --> 14:48.700
First,

14:48.910 --> 14:49.460
he secured

14:49.510 --> 14:50.650
the deed to Shanxiu Manor,

14:51.550 --> 14:52.180
which should be

14:52.200 --> 14:53.340
what he promised you yesterday.

14:53.910 --> 14:54.610
Second,

14:55.030 --> 14:56.300
he went to the Prefect's residence to trade.

14:57.320 --> 14:58.770
But not long after he left,

14:59.440 --> 15:01.060
the Prefect's son was found

15:01.120 --> 15:02.180
dead in his room.

15:02.840 --> 15:03.370
Ge Changsheng

15:03.390 --> 15:04.530
became the prime suspect.

15:05.750 --> 15:07.180
The enraged Prefect

15:07.360 --> 15:08.130
has thrown him in jail.

15:09.960 --> 15:11.140
Buns!

15:11.140 --> 15:13.270
Fresh hot pork buns!

15:13.320 --> 15:13.850
Halt.

15:18.360 --> 15:19.010
You again.

15:19.550 --> 15:19.980
Master Su,

15:20.670 --> 15:21.980
if you take Blood River

15:22.080 --> 15:23.060
and leave Nan'an City,

15:23.870 --> 15:24.530
Ge Changsheng

15:25.080 --> 15:26.530
will be released from prison.

15:27.000 --> 15:28.130
That's Lingxiao Sect's position?

15:28.510 --> 15:29.060
Naturally.

15:29.790 --> 15:31.220
We'll let Ge Changsheng go.

15:31.790 --> 15:32.220
But,

15:32.960 --> 15:34.420
Blood River and Changsheng Sect

15:35.120 --> 15:36.850
must get out of Nan'an City.

15:37.600 --> 15:38.630
Daffodil House

15:39.080 --> 15:41.370
is already posted at Changsheng Sect's base.

15:42.150 --> 15:43.650
They're of the same mind.

15:44.240 --> 15:45.700
So you two have teamed up.

15:45.870 --> 15:46.300
That's right.

15:47.150 --> 15:47.890
If you know what's good for you,

15:48.120 --> 15:48.700
then right now...

15:52.120 --> 15:53.530
You're not qualified to talk to me.

15:54.080 --> 15:54.620
What about me?

15:54.790 --> 15:55.130
You...

15:55.440 --> 15:56.530
That's Lingxiao Sect's Master.

16:00.600 --> 16:01.980
Am I qualified

16:02.510 --> 16:03.530
to speak with you?

16:07.670 --> 16:10.250
One block from here

16:10.320 --> 16:11.370
is the Prefect's residence.

16:12.200 --> 16:13.420
You want to see the Prefect?

16:17.600 --> 16:19.250
Su Muyu, are you crazy?

16:19.550 --> 16:20.460
You're not qualified either.

16:22.360 --> 16:23.250
He-Yu Clinic wishes

16:23.550 --> 16:24.650
to assist the Prefect

16:24.750 --> 16:26.180
in examining the young master's body.

16:28.090 --> 16:30.580
Sachets! Pendants! Take a look!

16:36.150 --> 16:37.180
Who are you?

16:37.480 --> 16:38.890
I hear your young master is dead,

16:39.270 --> 16:40.850
and the killer's a man of the martial world.

16:41.510 --> 16:42.490
So what if he is?

16:44.030 --> 16:45.850
Are you here to plead

16:45.910 --> 16:46.770
for the killer?

16:48.630 --> 16:50.060
He deserves death

16:50.360 --> 16:51.390
a thousand times over!

16:51.390 --> 16:53.420
What if I prove he isn't the killer?

16:54.360 --> 16:55.130
What did you say?

16:55.840 --> 16:56.850
The miracle physician's just recovered.

16:57.510 --> 16:58.850
Sir, please,

16:59.440 --> 17:00.890
come with me to the clinic.

17:10.350 --> 17:11.420
Sir, may I ask

17:12.480 --> 17:14.090
the cause of his death?

17:15.880 --> 17:16.850
The dagger in his chest

17:16.850 --> 17:18.050
was Ge Changsheng's cherished blade.

17:18.590 --> 17:19.530
Isn't it obvious

17:19.880 --> 17:21.570
Ge killed him with it?

17:22.480 --> 17:23.530
Ruling by a dagger alone

17:23.550 --> 17:24.900
is a bit hasty,

17:25.550 --> 17:26.900
isn't it?

17:28.920 --> 17:29.700
Quite right.

17:30.880 --> 17:32.050
He didn't die of a blade.

17:32.400 --> 17:34.490
Someone poisoned his wine.

17:35.270 --> 17:36.900
That dagger was thrust into his chest

17:37.070 --> 17:37.980
after he died.

17:38.270 --> 17:39.180
And you are?

17:42.400 --> 17:43.290
I've long heard

17:43.510 --> 17:44.490
of the miracle physician's name.

17:44.880 --> 17:45.490
But earlier,

17:45.920 --> 17:47.250
the coroner examined the body

17:48.270 --> 17:49.050
and found

17:49.070 --> 17:50.530
no sign of poison.

17:51.440 --> 17:51.940
That's because

17:52.640 --> 17:53.700
it wasn't ordinary poison.

18:22.550 --> 18:23.940
It was the Soul-Draining Pill.

18:24.440 --> 18:25.900
With this toxin,

18:26.440 --> 18:27.620
even the heart keeps beating

18:27.680 --> 18:28.620
after death,

18:28.920 --> 18:29.770
looking normal.

18:30.350 --> 18:31.180
But the brain

18:31.350 --> 18:32.450
has already been eaten clean

18:32.480 --> 18:33.770
by corpse-worms.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.420
So your coroner

18:35.590 --> 18:36.220
couldn't tell,

18:37.110 --> 18:38.010
and assumed

18:38.240 --> 18:40.010
the knife was driven in while he lived.

18:40.880 --> 18:42.330
You can open the skull and check.

18:42.680 --> 18:43.180
But mind

18:43.350 --> 18:44.460
the corpse-worms.

18:45.310 --> 18:46.140
If they bite you,

18:46.550 --> 18:48.140
you'll have to wait for my junior

18:48.200 --> 18:49.330
to return from the mountain with herbs

18:49.510 --> 18:50.220
to save you.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.010
I'm not good

18:52.510 --> 18:54.250
with these disgusting things.

19:12.640 --> 19:13.490
In Nan'an City,

19:14.640 --> 19:16.050
which sect is best with poison?

19:21.480 --> 19:22.770
Go check now!

19:23.070 --> 19:23.460
Understood!

19:26.640 --> 19:27.140
Sorry.

19:30.480 --> 19:31.530
What are you sorry for, sir?

19:32.750 --> 19:33.380
Without you,

19:34.110 --> 19:35.490
they'd have framed me,

19:36.070 --> 19:36.810
tortured me to death.

19:38.550 --> 19:38.940
By the way,

19:39.960 --> 19:40.980
I've got you

19:41.440 --> 19:42.330
the deed you wanted.

19:43.920 --> 19:44.660
I even found

19:44.830 --> 19:46.330
a fine location.

19:47.030 --> 19:47.530
Thanks...

19:49.310 --> 19:50.010
but keep it.

19:51.720 --> 19:52.140
What?

19:52.590 --> 19:53.900
The Prefect's son was killed

19:55.110 --> 19:57.460
by Lingxiao Sect and Daffodil House.

19:58.350 --> 19:59.700
They'll pay for it.

20:01.160 --> 20:01.900
If I hadn't asked you

20:01.960 --> 20:03.180
to help me,

20:04.310 --> 20:06.090
they wouldn't have framed you

20:06.750 --> 20:07.620
for failing to beat Blood River.

20:09.240 --> 20:09.620
Oh...

20:10.880 --> 20:11.620
If we don't have

20:11.680 --> 20:12.730
strong enough backing,

20:13.960 --> 20:15.530
trying to walk in the light

20:16.310 --> 20:17.660
will only bring more obstacles,

20:19.110 --> 20:20.090
and even drag down

20:20.160 --> 20:20.980
those who help us.

20:22.160 --> 20:24.010
This time it's just two Nan'an sects.

20:25.270 --> 20:26.140
If we truly found a sect,

20:27.270 --> 20:28.490
the whole Jiangnan

20:28.590 --> 20:29.420
would start to stir.

20:31.590 --> 20:32.810
Sir, you're planning to...

20:34.750 --> 20:35.770
I'm heading out on a long trip.

20:38.920 --> 20:39.420
Uncle Zhe,

20:41.510 --> 20:42.050
Changhe,

20:42.680 --> 20:44.010
any word from Yumo on the Tang Clan?

20:46.000 --> 20:46.490
None.

20:48.880 --> 20:49.520
What's up?

20:52.440 --> 20:53.140
Tang Clan

20:54.400 --> 20:55.620
might be our opening.

20:57.030 --> 20:57.810
Our opening?

20:59.830 --> 21:01.250
You want an alliance with the Tang Clan?

21:03.270 --> 21:04.360
I've thought it through.

21:05.030 --> 21:05.940
They're the best fit.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.140
They're a major sect,

21:08.920 --> 21:10.530
but work in hidden weapons and poison.

21:11.550 --> 21:12.730
When they were founded,

21:13.110 --> 21:14.460
the world wouldn't accept them,

21:14.960 --> 21:16.140
just like us now.

21:17.350 --> 21:17.810
Also,

21:18.550 --> 21:19.770
you told me days ago

21:20.480 --> 21:21.860
Night Crow tied to the First Prince

21:22.000 --> 21:23.050
headed toward the Tang Clan.

21:23.920 --> 21:25.420
Night Crow practices the drugged puppet craft.

21:26.000 --> 21:27.140
There's a scheme behind it,

21:27.880 --> 21:28.900
maybe even

21:29.720 --> 21:30.940
aimed at the Prince of Langya.

21:33.240 --> 21:33.730
Exactly.

21:35.790 --> 21:37.010
You mean,

21:37.200 --> 21:38.730
helping the clan crack that plot

21:39.200 --> 21:40.460
may win a shot at alliance,

21:41.720 --> 21:42.900
maybe even

21:43.110 --> 21:44.770
build some link to the Prince of Langya?

21:45.550 --> 21:46.090
What?

21:46.960 --> 21:48.770
So Blood River ends up on the imperial payroll?

21:49.790 --> 21:51.570
How's that different from the Shadow Sect before?

21:54.160 --> 21:55.140
The Prince of Langya is different.

21:56.070 --> 21:56.900
He stands

21:56.960 --> 21:58.140
for the brightest side of Beili.

22:02.030 --> 22:03.250
Sounds nice.

22:09.200 --> 22:10.180
Our teacher taught us

22:10.960 --> 22:12.570
walking streets like this at night

22:13.030 --> 22:14.140
is dangerous.

22:17.030 --> 22:18.380
Truth is, when you're asleep,

22:19.110 --> 22:20.770
I often walk alone at night.

22:22.550 --> 22:24.010
Nan'an's summer breeze is so gentle.

22:25.350 --> 22:26.050
I love it.

22:27.750 --> 22:28.460
I know.

22:29.030 --> 22:30.180
"When will the blazing sun pass,

22:30.880 --> 22:32.290
with no cool breeze to be found."

22:38.440 --> 22:38.900
What is it?

22:40.030 --> 22:41.330
Now that I'm leaving, I realize

22:42.030 --> 22:43.090
I never really looked closely

22:43.110 --> 22:44.090
at this city.

22:45.400 --> 22:46.490
So familiar, yet so strange.

22:48.830 --> 22:49.290
Oh...

22:51.510 --> 22:53.010
Today I passed a pastry shop.

22:53.350 --> 22:54.560
We've bought flower cake

22:54.560 --> 22:55.700
for Miss Bai so many times,

22:55.960 --> 22:56.900
yet never tried it ourselves.

22:58.350 --> 22:59.460
So I bought some to taste.

23:00.240 --> 23:00.570
Here.

23:06.180 --> 23:13.660
♪Wind cries and cranes call, are you the one...♪

23:17.200 --> 23:17.860
What are you smiling at?

23:18.830 --> 23:19.380
Nothing.

23:21.270 --> 23:22.380
I just realized something.

23:23.880 --> 23:25.050
We've known each other over twenty years,

23:26.270 --> 23:27.700
yet this seems like the first time

23:28.440 --> 23:29.220
we've strolled

23:29.270 --> 23:30.570
a summer night,

23:32.240 --> 23:33.660
eating flower cake,

23:34.400 --> 23:35.460
talking about

23:36.310 --> 23:37.380
nothing in particular.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.140
Seems so.

23:43.270 --> 23:43.980
Maybe...

23:46.880 --> 23:47.700
this is what it feels like

23:47.750 --> 23:48.940
to walk in the sunlight.

23:52.700 --> 23:55.820
♪I'm lucky to meet you...♪

23:57.350 --> 23:58.290
You're drunk, aren't you?

24:00.200 --> 24:01.180
Right now above us

24:01.200 --> 24:02.420
hangs the bright moon.

24:05.920 --> 24:06.420
Come on.

24:08.960 --> 24:09.460
Let's go.

24:12.030 --> 24:12.980
I'll take Qingyang and Xuewei

24:13.000 --> 24:14.290
back to Blood River to set this up.

24:14.790 --> 24:15.420
Then,

24:16.000 --> 24:16.700
we'll truly

24:16.790 --> 24:17.700
walk in the sun.

24:19.100 --> 24:24.500
♪This weary journey finds its end only because...♪

24:24.510 --> 24:27.860
Fresh lotus roots!

24:27.920 --> 24:30.290
Fresh lotus roots!

24:30.850 --> 24:33.260
Sachets! Pendants! Take a look!

24:33.260 --> 24:34.860
[No sound of autumn greets my wake]

24:34.860 --> 24:36.460
[Yet moonlit leaves proclaim its break]

24:36.460 --> 24:39.060
[Start of Autumn today: yang wanes, yin grows, and harvest begins]

24:41.160 --> 24:41.860
Su Muyu!

24:44.350 --> 24:45.900
Where's our Boss Su?

24:46.480 --> 24:47.180
Why isn't he here?

24:48.160 --> 24:49.140
He had things to handle,

24:49.550 --> 24:50.530
and already headed back to Blood River.

24:51.200 --> 24:51.980
I see.

24:52.720 --> 24:53.900
No wonder

24:54.110 --> 24:55.490
he suddenly seemed all smiles lately.

24:56.480 --> 24:57.380
Turns out he was leaving.

24:59.300 --> 25:02.580
[He-Yu Clinic]

25:12.030 --> 25:12.810
You're fine now.

25:13.720 --> 25:14.250
Senior,

25:14.270 --> 25:15.570
if anything comes up,

25:15.790 --> 25:16.810
just send me a message.

25:20.550 --> 25:21.050
Senior,

25:21.880 --> 25:22.490
then,

25:23.070 --> 25:23.860
I will take my leave.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.090
Don't rush.

25:26.720 --> 25:28.290
It's right about mealtime.

25:29.070 --> 25:29.940
Eat before you go.

25:30.110 --> 25:30.490
Muyu headed out

25:30.550 --> 25:31.490
early this morning,

25:31.680 --> 25:32.810
probably to buy groceries.

25:35.200 --> 25:35.810
Farewell!

25:38.240 --> 25:38.900
Farewell!

25:48.400 --> 25:49.220
You're in a hurry to leave?

25:50.200 --> 25:51.380
There are patients in my place.

25:51.550 --> 25:52.890
- It's urgent... - Senior.

25:53.270 --> 25:54.250
It's almost mealtime.

25:54.250 --> 25:55.180
Join our lunch before you go.

25:56.350 --> 25:57.140
It's Start of Autumn today.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.380
We should eat eggplant.

25:58.590 --> 25:59.660
I plan to cook myself.

26:01.310 --> 26:01.810
Farewell!

26:02.860 --> 26:03.710
Farewell...

26:08.440 --> 26:09.050
Muyu,

26:09.550 --> 26:10.620
did you...

26:10.960 --> 26:11.660
get the eggplants?

26:12.240 --> 26:12.770
Yeah.

26:15.110 --> 26:16.090
Fresh?

26:16.480 --> 26:17.050
Fresh.

26:18.000 --> 26:19.220
Store-bought hot food

26:19.400 --> 26:21.140
is never as healthy as home-cooked.

26:22.070 --> 26:22.980
Su Muyu,

26:23.310 --> 26:24.620
are you cooking again?

26:24.960 --> 26:26.570
That's the Start-of-Autumn custom.

26:27.000 --> 26:27.940
Custom?

26:28.480 --> 26:29.330
What custom?

26:29.680 --> 26:30.530
Eat eggplant on Start of Autumn.

26:31.880 --> 26:32.860
Keep away from the kitchen!

26:34.480 --> 26:34.980
Give it to me!

26:35.790 --> 26:36.530
Return the groceries!

26:36.790 --> 26:38.010
- Just an eggplant dish. - No!

26:38.240 --> 26:39.120
Trust me,

26:39.120 --> 26:40.290
nothing will go wrong!

26:40.750 --> 26:41.940
Like hell I believe that!

26:42.000 --> 26:43.400
I've developed a new recipe.

26:43.440 --> 26:44.010
Come on, return it!

26:44.680 --> 26:45.380
Give it back to me...

26:45.830 --> 26:47.250
It would be wonderful

26:47.350 --> 26:47.980
if Changhe were here,

26:48.750 --> 26:50.250
and we could just eat out.

26:54.110 --> 26:55.250
About Tang Lianyue,

26:55.880 --> 26:57.490
are you sure he never left Shuzhong

26:57.720 --> 26:59.050
after he returned to the Tang Clan?

26:59.510 --> 27:00.290
To be precise,

27:01.640 --> 27:03.010
he hasn't stepped past

27:03.440 --> 27:04.530
the Tang Clan gate.

27:05.030 --> 27:06.220
He's the Xuanwu Guardian,

27:06.590 --> 27:07.580
no court post,

27:07.580 --> 27:08.860
but charged with guarding Tianqi.

27:09.160 --> 27:11.400
Yet he went back and never came out.

27:12.640 --> 27:13.810
Interesting.

27:14.350 --> 27:15.010
So...

27:15.790 --> 27:16.620
Something must've happened.

27:17.030 --> 27:18.380
Let's go to the Tang Clan to propose.

27:20.240 --> 27:20.980
How about it?

27:21.920 --> 27:22.330
Really?

27:22.960 --> 27:23.460
Of course.

27:24.510 --> 27:25.660
This trip to the Tang Clan

27:25.680 --> 27:26.530
is very important.

27:27.240 --> 27:28.700
At least to Su Muyu,

27:29.680 --> 27:30.250
it is.

27:35.160 --> 27:35.570
Say it.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.220
Besides that,

27:38.350 --> 27:39.050
what else?

27:40.640 --> 27:41.700
Muyu says

27:42.070 --> 27:44.180
the ghost physician studying drugged puppet went to the Tang Clan.

27:44.680 --> 27:46.050
And there's a plot behind it,

27:46.270 --> 27:47.290
very likely aimed

27:47.350 --> 27:48.460
at the Prince of Langya.

27:50.240 --> 27:51.330
And I think

27:51.960 --> 27:53.900
Tang Lianyue is close to the Prince of Langya.

27:54.000 --> 27:55.250
If we get on with the Tang Clan,

27:55.310 --> 27:56.730
we get on with the Prince of Langya.

27:57.440 --> 27:58.250
In the jianghu,

27:58.790 --> 28:00.500
one more friend, one less risk.

28:01.720 --> 28:03.220
If we want to walk in the sunlight,

28:04.000 --> 28:05.220
we can't do it without friends.

28:06.790 --> 28:07.330
Qingyang.

28:08.550 --> 28:10.490
You and Xuewei have been to Shuzhong before.

28:11.030 --> 28:12.620
You two go scout ahead this time.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.380
As you command, Sir.

28:41.680 --> 28:42.490
This time,

28:43.270 --> 28:44.700
you need to help our Miss Mu

28:44.750 --> 28:45.730
pull off something big.

28:46.550 --> 28:47.730
Don't let your guard down.

28:49.200 --> 28:49.940
In the jianghu,

28:50.000 --> 28:51.530
few places are more dangerous,

28:52.350 --> 28:53.940
Tang Clan is one of them.

28:54.590 --> 28:55.380
If I let my guard down,

28:56.110 --> 28:57.090
I might never make it back.

28:58.480 --> 29:00.140
But I already wrote to Tang Linghuang,

29:00.680 --> 29:01.700
hoping to ally with them

29:02.400 --> 29:03.250
in Blood River's name.

29:04.070 --> 29:05.090
Why choose them?

29:06.030 --> 29:07.330
If Blood River is to stand tall,

29:08.000 --> 29:09.180
we need a powerful ally

29:09.240 --> 29:10.090
behind us.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.700
Tang Clan

29:13.350 --> 29:15.010
has long been misunderstood.

29:16.160 --> 29:17.460
Maybe they'll understand us.

29:18.310 --> 29:19.380
Tang Clan...

29:20.160 --> 29:21.090
are they that formidable?

29:21.590 --> 29:23.050
Their hidden weapons are first under heaven,

29:23.640 --> 29:24.900
their poisons second.

29:26.110 --> 29:27.700
Tang Fort is riddled with traps,

29:28.720 --> 29:29.980
a lion's den.

29:32.070 --> 29:33.980
Then who ranks first

29:34.110 --> 29:34.620
in poisons?

29:36.110 --> 29:37.220
The Wen clan, of course.

29:38.240 --> 29:38.770
Fine.

29:39.350 --> 29:40.380
Then let me,

29:40.590 --> 29:41.860
a direct heir of the Wen clan

29:42.000 --> 29:43.330
that outclasses Tang Clan in poison,

29:43.720 --> 29:44.620
give you a gift.

29:45.510 --> 29:45.980
It'll keep you

29:46.200 --> 29:46.940
unafraid of the Tang Clan.

29:47.480 --> 29:48.330
What is it this time?

29:50.070 --> 29:50.570
Come out, Green.

29:54.830 --> 29:55.250
Cute, right?

29:56.920 --> 29:58.530
Compared to Yumo's spiders,

29:58.590 --> 29:59.330
definitely cuter.

30:08.310 --> 30:08.900
Thank you.

30:10.880 --> 30:11.900
It's a Jade Serpent

30:12.310 --> 30:13.420
from the southwest.

30:14.030 --> 30:14.700
They say

30:14.750 --> 30:16.290
it likes to coil on jade,

30:16.790 --> 30:17.570
so its body

30:17.720 --> 30:19.370
slowly took on a jade-like hue.

30:20.160 --> 30:20.530
By the way,

30:20.790 --> 30:22.700
have you been to Mian City in the southwest?

30:23.640 --> 30:24.140
No.

30:25.350 --> 30:25.940
Pity.

30:26.480 --> 30:27.490
It's a fascinating place.

30:28.440 --> 30:30.860
One cut makes you rich, one cut leaves you broke,

30:31.200 --> 30:32.660
and one cut shrouds you in mourning white.

30:33.200 --> 30:34.010
There are

30:34.240 --> 30:35.860
mountains of rough stones.

30:36.030 --> 30:36.620
Split them open,

30:36.960 --> 30:38.420
maybe you'll find pure imperial green,

30:38.830 --> 30:39.700
or maybe

30:39.750 --> 30:41.490
just dull, chalk-white rock.

30:44.200 --> 30:45.530
Su Changhe's loaded.

30:45.960 --> 30:46.570
How about

30:46.880 --> 30:47.980
we trick him into going there?

30:48.440 --> 30:49.420
Changhe's too sharp.

30:50.350 --> 30:51.290
I can't fool him.

30:52.830 --> 30:53.570
Fine.

30:54.400 --> 30:56.140
Then keep this on you.

30:57.240 --> 30:57.900
If you

30:58.070 --> 30:58.980
get poisoned,

30:59.590 --> 31:00.490
just let it

31:00.720 --> 31:01.420
bite you once.

31:02.200 --> 31:02.940
Can it counter the poison?

31:03.510 --> 31:03.940
No.

31:04.680 --> 31:06.290
It's venomous head to tail,

31:07.110 --> 31:08.180
kills as soon as it meets blood.

31:08.880 --> 31:09.940
Kills on contact?

31:10.510 --> 31:10.980
Yes.

31:11.680 --> 31:12.980
Its venom is peculiar.

31:13.680 --> 31:15.250
When it meets another poison,

31:15.550 --> 31:16.730
the two create

31:16.790 --> 31:17.570
a strange counteracting effect.

31:18.400 --> 31:19.220
If you're poisoned by one,

31:19.440 --> 31:20.530
then let this Jade Serpent

31:20.590 --> 31:21.220
bite you.

31:21.960 --> 31:22.940
The poisons will counter each other,

31:23.880 --> 31:24.490
ensuring you

31:24.680 --> 31:25.700
won't die from it

31:26.000 --> 31:26.860
for at least ten days.

31:27.880 --> 31:28.660
If you're poisoned,

31:28.880 --> 31:29.700
let it bite you.

31:30.030 --> 31:30.900
Then rush back

31:31.000 --> 31:31.700
and find me at once.

31:32.160 --> 31:33.050
I'll detox you.

31:33.790 --> 31:34.460
Got it?

31:37.030 --> 31:37.570
Got it.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.290
But how do I care for it?

31:41.310 --> 31:41.860
By then,

31:41.920 --> 31:43.180
Ms. Yumo will be with you, right?

31:43.720 --> 31:44.810
Just have her

31:45.070 --> 31:46.330
toss a few spiders in

31:46.480 --> 31:46.940
each day.

31:48.000 --> 31:48.420
Okay.

31:54.550 --> 31:55.290
Su Muyu,

31:56.590 --> 31:57.330
tell me,

31:58.030 --> 31:59.140
what does it take

31:59.790 --> 32:01.530
to reach Blood River's Other Shore?

32:04.270 --> 32:04.900
At first,

32:05.350 --> 32:06.090
you thought

32:06.550 --> 32:08.010
to reach that Other Shore,

32:08.400 --> 32:09.630
you only had to topple

32:09.830 --> 32:12.140
the old Blood River families.

32:13.090 --> 32:13.960
Later,

32:14.200 --> 32:16.220
you beat the three former family heads,

32:16.480 --> 32:17.700
founded a new Blood River.

32:18.880 --> 32:19.700
But you found

32:20.200 --> 32:21.290
behind Blood River,

32:21.830 --> 32:23.570
another hand was pulling strings.

32:24.270 --> 32:25.490
So you went to Tianqi City,

32:25.920 --> 32:26.810
defeated Shadow Sect,

32:27.240 --> 32:28.490
burned their tower,

32:29.480 --> 32:30.290
and became

32:30.550 --> 32:31.900
a Blood River completely free.

32:32.830 --> 32:33.660
But now,

32:35.030 --> 32:36.220
you're heading for the Tang Clan

32:36.790 --> 32:37.900
to face new enemies.

32:39.790 --> 32:40.770
You and I both know,

32:42.000 --> 32:42.700
Tang Clan...

32:44.720 --> 32:45.660
may not be the end.

32:48.100 --> 32:51.740
♪Who can ford this river of night...♪

32:51.750 --> 32:52.980
It seems

32:53.750 --> 32:55.330
that fabled Other Shore

32:57.270 --> 32:59.090
is forever out of reach.

33:02.720 --> 33:04.180
Like when you were in Nan'an City,

33:05.110 --> 33:06.860
seemed to live a quiet life,

33:07.590 --> 33:08.290
yet still

33:09.200 --> 33:10.420
had to return to Blood River.

33:12.510 --> 33:14.010
Then let's hope it's the end this time.

33:16.070 --> 33:16.490
All right.

33:17.590 --> 33:19.420
I'll wait here in Nan'an City

33:20.440 --> 33:21.700
for your return.

34:21.190 --> 34:23.420
Senior, you're still the same,

34:24.150 --> 34:25.740
sharp as ever.

34:29.320 --> 34:30.940
I set this trap for so long,

34:31.510 --> 34:33.380
waiting here to poison you,

34:33.630 --> 34:35.170
yet you still saw through it.

34:36.190 --> 34:36.860
Night Crow,

34:38.150 --> 34:39.170
you finally show yourself!

34:41.880 --> 34:42.780
Senior,

34:43.510 --> 34:44.610
after all these years,

34:45.230 --> 34:47.050
you remember me at last.

34:48.230 --> 34:49.610
You've chased me so long.

34:50.440 --> 34:52.130
What do you want?

34:52.360 --> 34:53.420
Back then, you stole from me

34:53.440 --> 34:54.380
the drugged puppet craft.

34:55.230 --> 34:56.050
I took it back,

34:56.230 --> 34:57.530
and you swore to stop.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.570
But you broke your word.

35:00.510 --> 35:01.340
My Senior says

35:02.230 --> 35:03.860
you didn't just keep studying it,

35:04.230 --> 35:05.780
you even began refining the living!

35:06.760 --> 35:07.980
That's the greatest taboo of Medicine King Valley!

35:08.710 --> 35:10.340
As this generation's Medicine King,

35:10.840 --> 35:12.260
I must purge our house!

35:14.510 --> 35:16.420
Using the living to forge drugged puppet...

35:17.070 --> 35:18.340
Is this what you mean?

35:24.110 --> 35:25.260
You want to fight me?

35:27.510 --> 35:29.780
You're the one who won't let me go.

35:53.260 --> 35:56.740
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:56.780 --> 36:00.660
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:02.500 --> 36:05.980
♪Where's the Other Shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:06.020 --> 36:09.860
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

36:11.860 --> 36:15.140
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

36:15.260 --> 36:17.340
♪Still I can't let go♪

36:17.500 --> 36:20.940
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

36:21.420 --> 36:23.620
♪My heart no longer my own♪

36:23.740 --> 36:28.740
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:45.340 --> 36:49.060
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:49.180 --> 36:53.260
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:54.500 --> 36:58.380
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:58.500 --> 37:02.740
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

37:03.860 --> 37:06.740
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

37:06.820 --> 37:11.060
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

37:13.340 --> 37:17.340
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

37:17.380 --> 37:20.820
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

37:22.340 --> 37:25.780
